> Possible issues, abuses and enhancements:

Cloak of displacement would be a must.  Some means of paralysis,
stunning, confusion, would be very handy, unless they are immune.  I
can't think of any headless monsters that can wield weapons, but you
could give your pet vorpal blade, polymorph yourself into something
safe, and revive it.  You could also polymorph yourself into a weapon
user and rely on the polymorph life-saving effect.  Personally, I
would just outlaw polymorph on the level.  Land mines and bear traps
might be good to bring in (do monsters fight while in bear traps and
pits?).  And life saving, as you pointed out, is a good idea.

